      "message": "These changes aren\u0027t accepted upstream yet, so I am concerned about if there are UAPI changes requested during upstream review. If that happens, then Android code will have to figure out if it is talking to this \"botched\" UAPI or the fully upstream one.\n\nI\u0027m cautiously optimistic the UAPI will be accepted, so I wanted to make it so userspace didn\u0027t have to definitely maintain two UAPI bindings if this one is probably going to be accepted anyway.",
